```

## Configuration

Authentication uses `httpx.Auth`. See [httpx authentication docs](https://www.python-httpx.org/advanced/authentication/) for details.

Common auth types:
- `httpx.BasicAuth(username, password)`
- Custom `httpx.Auth` subclasses for bearer tokens, OAuth, etc.

Optional RPC options:
- `RpcClientConfiguration(timeout=..., base_url=..., headers=..., cookies=...)`

